#### Matter in Transformation

Matter is constantly changing in nature. The best example is the **water cycle**:

- Water in rivers and oceans is **liquid**;
- When the Sun heats it, water **evaporates** and becomes a **gas** (water vapor);
- In cold regions or high mountains, water **freezes** and becomes **ice**, a **solid**.

These transformations happen all the time, everywhere on Earth. Matter simply changes from one state to another.
